# ...but keep the bundled card stylesheet, which lives in a package directory
# named "resources" (Issue #44). Negate the dir + just its tracked file types,
# so the broad rule above doesn't drop it (and __pycache__ stays ignored).
!anki_miner/services/dictionary/resources/
!anki_miner/services/dictionary/resources/__init__.py
!anki_miner/services/dictionary/resources/*.css
# Same for the GUI theme JSONs (Issue #27 family, #48 Dracula). Climb each
# parent dir the broad resources/ rule excludes so themes/*.json can be tracked.
!anki_miner/gui/resources/
!anki_miner/gui/resources/styles/
!anki_miner/gui/resources/styles/themes/
!anki_miner/gui/resources/styles/themes/*.json
TECH_DEBT_AUDIT.md

